  Features:
  - Updated car traffic
  - 'New event: Drift Japan Togue'
  - 'New event: Nordburgring Time Attack'
  - Updated in-game chat system
  - Livery limit increased to 300
  - “Clear Additional Data” option added to Settings
  Items:
  - 'New location: Nordburgring'
  Fix:
  - Car sell/exchange moved to Direct Messages
  - Interior download moved to Visual Tuning
  - Business purchase mechanics updated
  - Arcade Mode removed
  - Interior deformation disabled
  - Car deformation reduced
  - Default camera positions adjusted
  - F1 wheels can now be reset
  - Car count added to the garages
  - Voice chat fixes
  - General bug fixes
